---
title: "commit_upgrade (Sui Framework: package)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_destruct: UpgradeReceipt(cap_id, package) destructured
    q_destruct --> q_check_cap: assert object::id(cap) == cap_id
    q_check_cap --> q_abort_cap: wrong cap
    q_abort_cap --> [*]: abort EWrongUpgradeCap
    q_check_cap --> q_check_pending: cap matches
    q_check_pending --> q_abort_pending: cap.package != @0x0
    q_abort_pending --> [*]: abort ENotAuthorized
    q_check_pending --> q_update: has pending upgrade
    q_update --> q_inc_version: cap.package = package (new)
    q_inc_version --> [*]: cap.version = cap.version + 1

    note right of q_check_cap
        INV-001: receipt must match the originating UpgradeCap
        INV-002: cap must have a pending upgrade (package == @0x0)
        INV-003: version incremented monotonically
        INV-004: cap.package updated to new package ID
    end note
